      "start_line": 28,
      "source": "@Override\n   public Block block() {\n      Holder<Item> item = this.itemStack.get(AEComponents.FACADE_ITEM);\n      return item != null && item.value() instanceof BlockItem blockItem ? blockItem.getBlock() : Blocks.AIR;\n   }"
